# Shared ignore list for the images in this folder. Docker only reads a
# .dockerignore next to the build context root, so the repository root file
# (../../.dockerignore) is the one that takes effect — this copy documents the
# intent and is kept in sync with it.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
.git
.github
.claude
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
ml/models
ml/datasets
**/coverage
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
